      "text": "Today class i learnt mondo db set up. how to download mongodb, install, and \nthen on mongodb atlas platform create oraganization then project name for \ndatabase after i create cluster and took free virtual machine for transform \ndata from database to server. then i learnt provider aws, microsoft azure, \ngoogle cloud platform (gcp), then i deploy database. after that clustor give\n me database give me connection string and password for connection database. \nSo for that i installed mongodb compass. Mongodb compass is a gui for visualize \nall data like users, products, login, register user, all rest thing about data. then\n in compass there is connection icone inside i put connection link and password \nand then connect my compass to database.",
